# a2a-demo coordinator (A2A .NET SDK 1.0.0-preview2, A2A v1.0 JSON-RPC binding).
# Start (from this folder): dotnet run coordinator.cs
# SendMessage delegates to the specialist, which must be running on http://localhost:5062.
@host = http://localhost:5063

### Server info
GET {{host}}/

### Well-known agent card
GET {{host}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### A2A JSON-RPC SendMessage (delegates to the specialist)
POST {{host}}/a2a/coordinator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "SendMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "local-client-2",
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "parts": [
        { "text": "delegate this" }
      ]
    }
  }
}
